# OWNER REVIEW
# The bake sale at St. Prudence's (Key 2; levels/primrose/keys/bake_sale.gd): the stallholder fetches the cake from
# under the counter. The cake is a box of toys with icing on it.

~ cake
[narrator] The stallholder sets it down: a cake, iced pink, RESERVED piped across the top. It rattles.
Stallholder: It's for Mrs Gander. Special order. I've not looked inside it. I've been told not to look inside it.
[narrator] Under the icing, a box. In the box, twelve of Swyne's toys, packed in sponge.
Nim: Lovely crumb.
